{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Fast_and_Easy_🔥🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Fast and Easy 🔥🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Speedrun/Fast_(ft._Explanations!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Speedrun/Fast (ft. Explanations!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Casey went on a road trip that covered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles, stopping only for a lunch break along the way. The trip took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours in total and her average speed while driving was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. In minutes, how long was the lunch break?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/d/57dc98b2ec3dd1f0594d7b965cafdce7057af38d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }15 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }30 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }40 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }45 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cab60b2213b75825c245de22af72fdc0876898ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ \\text{ Total distance } }{ \\text{ Total time } }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/6141aa6ada01425e385ebecc94aadc1f0b945ab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{3-t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"44\" height=\"40\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cfbd70d037047f2955d7a2bede3c26d5174adce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{3-t} = 40 \\Rightarrow 3-t = \\frac{5}{2} \\Rightarrow t = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"262\" height=\"40\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/2409f545a9a91d2a160aa06312d05572858db377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } 30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>~OlympiadMaster\n</p><p>nah we can just do it like this. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour means we can do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mile in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. so we multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> minutes or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. (this is how long it took her to drive, and if the total time is three hours we do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> to get our answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/2409f545a9a91d2a160aa06312d05572858db377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } 30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>thanks pookies\n~pereena\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Average speed is total distance over total time. Thus, the total time spent driving is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> and the total distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, the average speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/4/cd48ac712c17e0642d2eac1a0941df5f98de1950.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100/t = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"20\" />. Solving, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/72829773c07f5d6b11b82149d3b4b9be59b629a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 100/40 = 10/4 = 5/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"199\" height=\"20\" /> hours, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. She drove for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours, and thus her lunch break was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6ca687be571fd4a2945b7915e61ea0f2509df801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the trip took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours in total and her average speed was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, we know she would have traveled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles. Since she only traveled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles with a lunch break, she would have traveled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles if she didn't have a lunch break. Since her average speed was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, the lunch break took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c5523004b1fb54fae5c29c9865997856da4d7f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60*\\frac{20}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6ca687be571fd4a2945b7915e61ea0f2509df801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>~FJH07\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Casey drove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> miles at a constant rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph, we can say it took her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c3489e63080431736673c5ed428099ab1406c069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100/40 = 2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" /> hours to drive to his/her destination WITHOUT a break. The problem mentioned the trip took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfb4d9d88e10386ce2a34f17ccd2f8c98ea08d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> hours yields a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> hours or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/2409f545a9a91d2a160aa06312d05572858db377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } 30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Ingeniouspeacock36\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using dimensional analysis, her time spent driving is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c46f45cd21a8f18270f7cc3e4c23e622652ba5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[100 \\text{ miles}\\cdot \\frac{ 1 \\text{ hour} }{ 40 \\text{ miles} } = 2.5 \\text{ hours}.\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"37\" />\nTherefore, she spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/6686cb63ac666a5e8ffa404e39fad9bfe5be852b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 2.5 = 0.5 \\text{ hours}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" /> during her lunch break or\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d24dbf923822d068b641872df6a317b83e0873.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0.5 \\text{ hours} \\cdot \\frac{60 \\text{ minutes}}{1 \\text{ hour}} = \\boxed{ \\textbf{(B) } 30} \\text{ minutes}.\\]\" width=\"320\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEM Simplified\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBE2kwg_xLQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBE2kwg_xLQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Fast_and_Easy_.F0.9F.94.A5.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"